   FROM PROJECT INNER JOIN EMPLOYEE USING (EMPLOYEE_ID) 
   GROUP BY PROJECT_ID;
   -> For project 1: average = (10 + 10 + 4)/3 = 8.00

   Running Q2:
   SELECT PROJECT_ID, ROUND(AVG(EXPERIENCE_YEARS), 2) AS AVERAGE_YEARS
   FROM EMPLOYEE JOIN PROJECT USING (EMPLOYEE_ID) 
   GROUP BY PROJECT_ID;
   -> For project 1: average = (10 + 4)/2 = 7.00
   Thus, the two queries yield different results.
*/

